#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:5 439d33433a64499a8ecf4be338d3d520
msgid "QuikTune"
msgstr "QuikTune"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:10 4017f9a9fb094901914a4de6c7d198ba
msgid ""
"The `Rover QuikTune "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.md>`__ Lua script simplifies the process of finding good gains for"
" a vehicle's steering and speed controllers."
msgstr ""
"`Rover QuikTune "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.md>`__ Lua 脚本简化了为车辆转向和速度控制器寻找合适增益的过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:12 2de19622d3d34fe9bc42c9cc90d395d2
msgid ""
"The script should be run while the vehicle is circling in :ref:`Circle mode "
"<circle-mode>`. It records the steering and throttle outputs and the "
"resulting response (e.g. vehicle's turn rate and speed) for at least 10 "
"seconds in order to calculate the feed-forward gains. The P and I gains are "
"then set to a ratio of the feed-forward's. Once complete the gains are saved"
" automatically."
msgstr ""
"该脚本应在车辆以 :ref:`Circle 模式 <circle-mode>` "
"绕圈行驶时运行。脚本记录转向和油门输出及其对应的响应（如车辆的转弯速率和速度），时长至少 10 秒，以计算前馈增益。P 和 I "
"增益随后被设置为前馈增益的比例值。完成后增益将自动保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:17 1fae7229c6f04b4fb8eab898eb70606a
msgid "By default the gains will be tuned in this order:"
msgstr "默认情况下，增益将按以下顺序进行调整："

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:19 4ea0c53fa12342a09c2605a332775ebf
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FF <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`, then :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_P "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_P>` and I are set to ratios of the FF"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FF <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`，然后 :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_P "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_P>` 和 I 被设置为 FF 的比例值"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:20 d5c935f99b8e4118a52a6fdf2f0c0621
msgid ""
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` and :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE "
"<CRUISE_THROTTLE>`, then :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>` and I are set to "
"ratios of the FF"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` 和 :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE "
"<CRUISE_THROTTLE>`，然后 :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>` 和 I 被设置为 FF 的比例值"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:22 684aa179b127481a94e4f07562e230d0
msgid "The script will also adjust filter settings:"
msgstr "脚本还将调整滤波器设置："

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:24 dc8e98fd16f84cc496ea859c81563c51
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FLTD <ATC_STR_RAT_FLTD>` and FLTT will be set to half of "
"the :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER <INS_GYRO_FILTER>` value"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FLTD <ATC_STR_RAT_FLTD>` 和 FLTT 将被设置为 "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER <INS_GYRO_FILTER>` 值的一半"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:27 0dd2c432ff6c42b1877a1be301f339e1
msgid "Installing the Script"
msgstr "安装脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:29 0700a8c0da6146e396bde058ca986499
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable scripting and then reboot "
"the autopilot"
msgstr "将 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用脚本功能，然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:30 29d2ac3aea13450b982ba4fc319c989d
msgid ""
"Download `rover-quicktune.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.lua>`__ to your PC"
msgstr ""
"将 `rover-quicktune.lua "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.lua>`__ 下载到您的电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:31 0e2451afdf754b68bc5c0213af1a6c3a
msgid ""
"Copy the script to your autopilot's SD card's APM/scripts directory.  If "
"using MP it may be easiest to use the Config, MAVFtp screen"
msgstr "将脚本复制到飞控 SD 卡的 APM/scripts 目录。如果使用 MP，可以通过 Config、MAVFtp 界面操作，较为方便"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:37 4b7bd564116c40f990e066abf9fd9218
msgid "Reboot the autopilot and set RTUN_ENABLE = 1"
msgstr "重启飞控，并将 RTUN_ENABLE 设为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:38 8c2412018a424a1fb5a686030f349bdb
msgid ""
"If an RC switch will be used to start/stop the tune set RCx_OPTION = 300 "
"where \"x\" is the RC input channel number.  Alternatively set one of "
"Mission Planner's Aux Function tab's rows to \"Scripting1\""
msgstr ""
"若要使用遥控开关来启动/停止调参，请将 RCx_OPTION = 300（其中 「x」 为 RC 输入通道编号）。也可在 Mission Planner"
" 的 Aux Function 选项卡中将某行设为 「Scripting1」"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:45 adc26c436ffb422e9cb3cbeb6f5f158b
msgid "Running QuikTune"
msgstr "运行 QuikTune"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:47 17854f425b8d471bb2c02b578104254c
msgid "Go to an open area with good GPS reception"
msgstr "前往 GPS 信号良好的开阔区域"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:48 cb5e551bab30407b96b8f0a6385c3fec
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station (e.g Mission Planner or QGC) and ensure that "
"the Messages tab can be seen.  This is where output from the tune will "
"appear"
msgstr ""
"使用地面站（如 Mission Planner 或QGroundControl）连接飞行器，并确保能看到消息标签页。调参过程中的输出信息将显示在此处"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:49 b846af05aa164fe6b9fd28efa2fb997e
msgid ""
"Move the RC switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's \"Low\" "
"button"
msgstr "将 RC 开关拨到低位，或按下 Mission Planner 辅助功能中的「Low」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:50 00f21938122d42ccb3b5a7298041d57f
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`CIRC_SPEED <CIRC_SPEED>` to about half the vehicle's "
"maximum speed"
msgstr "可选：将 :ref:`CIRC_SPEED <CIRC_SPEED>` 设为车辆最大速度的大约一半"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:51 4d3ebc6e6a1f4223b1882cbe81ea6e84
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle, drive to an open area and switch to :ref:`Circle mode "
"<circle-mode>`"
msgstr "解锁车辆，驾驶到开阔区域并切换到 :ref:`圆形模式 <circle-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:52 6f73e3a7bdda41e98029d51d2d3bd7f6
msgid ""
"Begin the tune by moving the RC switch to the middle position OR push MP's "
"Aux Function's \"Mid\" button"
msgstr "将遥控开关拨到中位，或按下 MP Aux Function 的 「Mid」 按钮以开始调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:53 86187cd34fce47bbb577395bc17ed21b
msgid "Monitor the progress of the tune using the GCS's Messages tab"
msgstr "通过地面站的消息标签页监控调参进度"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:54 b51e226b623a48599732e10b937b3312
msgid ""
"If the RC steering and throttle sticks are moved from their center position "
"the tuning will be paused until a few seconds after they are moved back to "
"their center position"
msgstr "若 RC 转向和油门摇杆偏离中位，调参将暂停，直至摇杆回到中位几秒后才会继续"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:55 7fa9b9760b8845c0aa6b4afbb8ec95fd
msgid ""
"If the vehicle begins oscillating violently cancel the tune by moving the RC"
" switch to the low position OR push MP's Aux Function's \"Low\" button"
msgstr "若车辆开始剧烈振荡，请将遥控开关拨回低位，或按下 MP Aux Function 的 「Low」 按钮以取消调参"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:56 7f40a94efb3b4601b8ff8355a9d1c4e5
msgid "Once the tune has completed the new gains will be saved automatically"
msgstr "调参完成后，新的增益值将自动保存"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:57 916cc006565d448394c505e9fbc4ab24
msgid "Drive the vehicle home and disarm"
msgstr "将车辆驾驶回起点并加锁"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:60 2c17d1a7b5144650a2841bffa70c5739
msgid "Advanced Configuration"
msgstr "高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/quiktune.rst:62 1b9371b21ca04308b18ea863c48e3b3d
msgid ""
"The full list of available `parameter settings are here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.md>`__"
msgstr ""
"完整的可用 `参数设置列表见此 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/Rover-4.5/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.md>`__"
